FINAL FANTASY VII

  FINAL FANTASY VII, FINAL FANTASY VII REMAKE, FINAL FANTASY VII REMAKE
  INTERGRADE, FINAL FANTASY VII REBIRTH and CRISIS CORE -FINAL FANTASY VII-,
  together with their names, characters, stories, logos and trademarks,
  © SQUARE ENIX CO., LTD. All Rights Reserved.

  This project is not made, approved, endorsed or sponsored by Square Enix.

Artwork  (apps/web/public/art, apps/web/public/thumbs, apps/web/src/music/*/cover.webp)

  Every picture is official Square Enix material: key art, character renders
  and illustrations, concept art, in-game stills and promotional screenshots,
  © SQUARE ENIX CO., LTD. Character design by Tetsuya Nomura (and Roberto
  Ferrari for the Remake series); FINAL FANTASY VII logo illustration by
  Yoshitaka Amano. Pictures were found through the Final Fantasy Wiki
  (https://finalfantasy.fandom.com). Each one is listed, with its title, artist
  and source, in apps/web/src/art/details.ts and on the site's Credits page.

Music  (apps/web/src/music)

  All music © SQUARE ENIX CO., LTD. All Rights Reserved.

  Final Fantasy VII (1997) ..... composed by Nobuo Uematsu
  Crisis Core ................... composed by Takeharu Ishimoto
  Final Fantasy VII Remake ...... original music by Nobuo Uematsu; arranged by
                                  Yoshitaka Suzuki, Shotaro Shima, Yasunori
                                  Nishiki, Tadayoshi Makino and Kenichiro Fukui;
                                  additional composition by Masashi Hamauzu,
                                  Tadayoshi Makino and Yasunori Nishiki.
                                  "Hollow": vocals by Yosh,
                                  lyrics by Kazushige Nojima
  Final Fantasy VII Rebirth ..... original music by Nobuo Uematsu; arranged by
                                  Shotaro Shima, Yasunori Nishiki, Ryo Furukawa
                                  and Tsutomu Narita; additional composition by
                                  Shotaro Shima and Ryo Furukawa.
                                  "No Promises to Keep":
                                  vocals by Loren Allred, lyrics by Kazushige
                                  Nojima

  Each track's composer, arranger, vocalist and lyricist is credited in its
  album's album.json and shown in the site's Config window.

